---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — ModestyLoom"
  description="Read ModestyLoom's commitment to user data privacy, analytics disclosures, cookies policy, and ethical digital journalism standards."
>
  <div style="background-color: var(--bg-surface); padding: 3.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
        Last updated: March 2026 • Effective immediately
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; padding-top: 3.5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      ModestyLoom operates as an editorial publication. We do not harvest sensitive personal data, mandate user accounts, or maintain intrusive digital trackers. Information voluntarily provided through our contact forms (such as names and email addresses) is used solely to respond to editorial inquiries.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem;">2. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      We use browser local storage exclusively to preserve your preferred visual display mode (such as your Light or Dark Mode preference). We do not deploy third-party advertising cookies or cross-site tracking pixels without explicit consent.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem;">3. Affiliate Links & External Merchants</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Our shopping discovery articles and curated product pages may contain outbound affiliate links. If you follow an outbound link to a third-party merchant site, that platform operates under its own independent privacy terms and data practices.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem;">4. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      For any inquiries regarding data protection and digital privacy on ModestyLoom, please reach out via <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--accent-gold); text-decoration: underline;">our contact desk</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
